    "Id": "chassisdef_hermes_iii_HER-6K",
    "Name": "Hermes III",
    "Details": "The Hermes III HER-6K is the first upgrade of the Hermes III by Luthien Armor Works, where they completely refreshed the original Hermes III HER-4K by Ostmann Industries with considerably more recent technology. Its two Snub-Nose PPCs are linked together through an advanced Targeting Computer for improved performance, and a Guardian ECM provide basic electronic warfare capabilities. A C3 Slave also ensures the 'Mech performs well in advanced lances.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.02</color></b>",
